---
description: Write a CONTEXT.md handoff when the chat is near the context limit
alwaysApply: false
---

- When approaching the context limit, write a handoff under 200 words in `CONTEXT.md` (or append to @AGENTS.md).
- Use full file paths. Include branch, pending tasks, known bugs, and next steps.
- Use the "Session Continuation Context" template in @AGENTS.md.
- On a new session, read that summary before changing code.
